<%# Before a deploy (Docker isn't answering) or read off its log. %>
<p>
  Roe builds your site's image with Docker before sending it to your server.
  Docker has to be running on this computer for a deploy to work.
</p>

<ol>
  <li>Open Docker Desktop and wait for it to finish starting.</li>
  <li><%= context == :settings ? "Then reload this page." : "Then deploy again." %></li>
</ol>

<p>
  More detail:
  <a href="/documentation/roe/troubleshoot-deployment#troubleshooting-kamal" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Troubleshooting → Deployment</a>
</p>
